Package: isotidy
Title: Standardize and Process Isotope Ratio Mass Spectrometry Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Annie C.", "Edwards", , "acedwards@caltech.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Customizable tools for importing, standardizing, validating, and processing IRMS data from multiple peripherals. Consolidates configurable peripheral outputs into single canonical dataset for further processing.
